{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05127","headline":"从驩州廨宅移住山间水亭赠苏使君 · 沈佺期","name":"从驩州廨宅移住山间水亭赠苏使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遇坎即乘流，西南到火洲。\n鬼门应苦夜，瘴浦不宜秋。\n岁贷胸穿老，朝飞鼻饮头。\n死生离骨肉，荣辱间朋游。\n弃置一身在，平生万事休。\n鹰鸇遭误逐，豺虎怯真投。\n忆昨京华子，伤今边地囚。\n愿陪鹦鹉乐，希并鹧鸪留。\n日月渝乡思，烟花换客愁。\n幸逢苏伯玉，回借水亭幽。\n山柏张青盖，江蕉卷绿油。\n乘闲无火宅，因放有渔舟。\n适越心当是，居夷迹可求。\n古来尧禅舜，何必罪驩兜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}